        "  - Run 'Firefox Nightly Profile Manager', choose 'Scoop-Nightly' then click 'Start Nightly'.",
        "  - Visit 'about:profiles' page in Firefox Nightly to check *DEFAULT* profile.",
        "For details: https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/profile-manager-create-remove-switch-firefox-profiles"
    ],
    "architecture": {
        "64bit": {
            "url": "https://archive.mozilla.org/pub/firefox/nightly/2026/08/2026-08-26-20-55-48-mozilla-central/firefox-156.0a1.en-US.win64.installer.exe#/dl.7z",
            "hash": "sha512:97a440e5ea3f2555ec86ef06bd3f10d52a82247c4f8d649f594a1e129ea9d9ffa4a835cb00c8cb59b8568029fa828602713b2a0cfe322dfcdbecfb2eb216d50e"
        },
        "32bit": {
            "url": "https://archive.mozilla.org/pub/firefox/nightly/2026/08/2026-08-26-20-55-48-mozilla-central/firefox-156.0a1.en-US.win32.installer.exe#/dl.7z",
